  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: Did you know your mom and I played soccer when were were kids?
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Yeah, Mom made that for her when we were kids, and Dad...
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Grandpa loved playing with us.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "So that\u2019s why she has a soccer quilt...she never struck
      me as a sports person."
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
    RelationshipRange: {x: 0, y: 0}
    BranchingDialogueHigh: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e63a3ab206057954c87a23c16be23a06, type: 2}
    BranchingDialogueNeutral: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogueLow: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Assertive_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Oh ,you\u2019re definitely better than me."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: I kicked my ball over the fence on the regular, but your mom...
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Your mom was the best player on the playground.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "It\u2019s in your blood, for sure."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I\u2019m sure I\u2019m better than both of you."
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
    RelationshipRange: {x: 0, y: 0}
    BranchingDialogueHigh: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e63a3ab206057954c87a23c16be23a06, type: 2}
    BranchingDialogueNeutral: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogueLow: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -5
  Sappy_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Well, your mom was the best soccer player on the playground, but
        she never tried out for the school team.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Me?
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "Let\u2019s just say I kicked enough soccer balls over the fence
        for them to give me a WIDE berth."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Mom never told me she was on a soccer team.
